{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demons are rising up slowly from the underworld and taking over the world. You are an\u00a0agent of the undercover demon hunt group, disguised as a church. As an agent your\u00a0mission is to breakthrough the dungeons occupied by demons and recover the world with\u00a0the power of light bit by bit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Follow the light</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has a huge limitation regarding visual range. Overall, you could see only the portions of the map, where the light is lit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll play as 2 type of agent,</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sword Type</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/SwordGif.gif?t=1749617993\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gun Type</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/GunGif.gif?t=1749617993\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Basic Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WASD / Arrow Key - Movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Space - Dash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Left mouse - Attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tab - Change weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">F - Pray / Interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hunting Demons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/Hunting540.gif?t=1749617993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are swarms of demons everywhere that's blocking your way. As you hunt them down, you will gain experience and get stronger, along with an opportunity to get a stat upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These demons will drop items such as a heart, or a fire looking soul for you to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Lighting Candles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/lightCandle540_.gif?t=1749617993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are candles scattered around the area. The fires coming out from the demons are needed to light the candles. Light all of them to progress to the next stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/CursorReact540.gif?t=1749617993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be aware of how the cursor reacts to the candles. the more closer it is to the candle, the more faster it starts to react.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Praying</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/MpHeal540.gif?t=1749617993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Praying is initiated when holding the F key. hold long enough to heal the MP yourself. Praying is also used for lighting candles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hidden Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/EventGate540.gif?t=1749617993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden events could randomly happen while exploring the dungeon. It's up to you to check it out.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3737700?t=1749617993","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3737700?t=1749617993","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/dfdcc85194c0d562c310b8f5a9a74ecea046b4f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749617993","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/dfdcc85194c0d562c310b8f5a9a74ecea046b4f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749617993","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: \r\n**Blood Warning, Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demons are rising up slowly from the underworld and taking over the world. You are an\u00a0agent of the undercover demon hunt group, disguised as a church. As an agent your\u00a0mission is to breakthrough the dungeons occupied by demons and recover the world with\u00a0the power of light bit by bit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Follow the light</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has a huge limitation regarding visual range. Overall, you could see only the portions of the map, where the light is lit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll play as 2 type of agent,</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sword Type</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/SwordGif.gif?t=1749617993\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gun Type</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/GunGif.gif?t=1749617993\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Basic Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WASD / Arrow Key - Movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Space - Dash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Left mouse - Attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tab - Change weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">F - Pray / Interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hunting Demons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/Hunting540.gif?t=1749617993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are swarms of demons everywhere that's blocking your way. As you hunt them down, you will gain experience and get stronger, along with an opportunity to get a stat upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These demons will drop items such as a heart, or a fire looking soul for you to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Lighting Candles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/lightCandle540_.gif?t=1749617993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are candles scattered around the area. The fires coming out from the demons are needed to light the candles. Light all of them to progress to the next stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/CursorReact540.gif?t=1749617993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be aware of how the cursor reacts to the candles. the more closer it is to the candle, the more faster it starts to react.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Praying</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/MpHeal540.gif?t=1749617993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Praying is initiated when holding the F key. hold long enough to heal the MP yourself. Praying is also used for lighting candles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hidden Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/extras/EventGate540.gif?t=1749617993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden events could randomly happen while exploring the dungeon. It's up to you to check it out.</p>","developers":["dothouse0"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737700/c9e26d37b5cbe65fa16768acc3f8049045e6d629/header.jpg?t=1749617993","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257146817,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146817/movie480.mp4?t=1748387934","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146817/movie_max.mp4?t=1748387934"},"name":"Light Followers Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257146817/c183ea3ae69010ae4f9526b47607979e2062e097/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748387934","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146817/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748387934","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146817/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748387934"}}],"name":"Light Followers: Blinded by the Dark","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Light Followers: Blinded by the Dark - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$2.99</span> $2.39 USD","packageid":1315698,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-20% ","price_in_cents_with_discount":239}],"title":"Buy Light Followers: Blinded by the Dark"}],"packages":[1315698],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"U